    say 0x028A voice=0x03 flags=0x00 display=0x80 loop=none control=none : "BIONIUM is an energy substance found in Cyberspace pockets..."
    say 0x028A voice=0x04 flags=0x00 display=0x80 loop=none control=none : "If we could get hold of a BIONIUM container, then all we'd have to do is enter Cyberspace to collect the stuff..."
    say 0x028A voice=0x05 flags=0x00 display=0x80 loop=none control=none : "BIONIUM sells for big money, Commander|. It's the power source for all robots..."
    say 0x028A voice=0xFF flags=0x28 display=0x80 loop=none control=none : "This could be a major breakthrough, Commander|. All we need is a BIONIUM container..."
